  "status": "present",
  "value": "A card is a string: rank (\"2\"..\"10\", \"J\", \"Q\", \"K\", \"A\") followed by a suit letter S, H, D or C; cards in the deck are distinct. numPlayers players (2..17) each receive three cards: deck has 3 * numPlayers distinct cards and card i (0-based) goes to player (i mod numPlayers) + 1. Hands are ranked with the level-1 categories and tie-breaks. Return [hands, winners]: hands lists every player's cards in deal order and winners lists, ascending, every player whose hand is strongest (several on a tie).",
